     1514   field cash-num      as integer
     1515   field cash-num-char as character
     1516   field port-num      as character
     1517   field way           as character
     1518   field is-script     as logical
     1519   field pswd          as character
     1520   field waiting-sek   as integer
     1521   field other-info    as character
     1522   field order-num     as integer
     1523   field secondary     as integer
     1524   field shift-fields  as integer
     1525   field binary        as logical
     1526   field range         as integer
